WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.665
Group the list when you need to compare studios, rather than read one long queue.

00:00:04.665 --> 00:00:06.555
Use Group to choose Studio.

00:00:06.555 --> 00:00:09.355
Each section has its own heading and ticket count.

00:00:09.355 --> 00:00:12.615
Use Then by to split each studio by priority.

00:00:12.615 --> 00:00:15.185
Collapse a section to focus on the next one.

00:00:15.185 --> 00:00:20.585
Grouping changes how the queue is displayed, not which studio or priority a ticket belongs to.
